<li about="#cite_note-AndroidSecurityBulletin-2" id="cite_note-AndroidSecurityBulletin-2" data-mw-footnote-number="2"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwAQ0"><a href="#cite_ref-AndroidSecurityBulletin_2-0" id="mwAQ4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwAQ8">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-AndroidSecurityBulletin_2-1" id="mwARA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwARE">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-AndroidSecurityBulletin-2" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt12" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwARI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" id="mwARM"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://source.android.com/security/bulletin/2017-04-01" class="external text" id="mwARQ">"Android Security Bulletin – April 2017"</a>. <i id="mwARU">Android.com</i>. Android Open Source Project. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20170419180717/https://source.android.com/security/bulletin/2017-04-01" class="external text" id="mwARY">Archived</a> from the original on April 19, 2017<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwARc">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwARg">April 5,</span> 2017</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Android.com&amp;rft.atitle=Android+Security+Bulletin+%E2%80%93+April+2017&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fsource.android.com%2Fsecurity%2Fbulletin%2F2017-04-01&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AAndroid+KitKat" class="Z3988" id="mwARk"></span></span></li>
